<section class="saas-legal-page">
  <div class="saas-container saas-page-shell">
    <div class="saas-page-hero">
      <p class="saas-legal-kicker">Kawaii Stickers</p>

      <h1>Kawaii Sticker Maker</h1>

      <p>
        Make kawaii AI stickers from cute prompts for animals, snacks, flowers, cozy objects,
        mascots, and expressive characters.
      </p>
      <a class="saas-button saas-button-primary" href="/#generator">Make Kawaii Stickers</a>
    </div>

    <div class="saas-info-grid">
      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Cute prompt structure</h2>

        <p>
          Use one main subject, a soft emotion, simple colors, and a sticker border direction.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Kawaii batch ideas</h2>

        <p>
          Try a matching set like sleepy kitten, happy coffee cup, tiny strawberry, and smiling cloud.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="saas-info-panel">
        <h2>Variations</h2>

        <p>
          Regenerate your favorite idea with a new pose, expression, accessory, or color palette.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Kawaii sticker prompt formula</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>Pick one small subject: animal, snack, flower, cloud, cup, charm, or mascot.</li>

        <li>Add one soft emotion: sleepy, happy, shy, proud, surprised, cozy, or excited.</li>

        <li>Use kawaii style words: rounded, soft colors, tiny accessory, clean white border.</li>

        <li>Generate a batch with related subjects to build a consistent cute sticker set.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Kawaii sticker prompt examples</h2>

      <div class="saas-prompt-list">
        <code>tiny strawberry waving, kawaii sticker, soft pink colors, white border</code>
        <code>sleepy kitten with moon pillow, rounded cute icon, clean outline</code>
        <code>happy coffee cup with tiny scarf, kawaii mascot sticker, simple background</code>
        <code>smiling cloud holding a star, pastel sticker, crisp border</code>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="saas-seo-block">
      <h2>Kawaii sticker set ideas</h2>

      <p>
        Build sets around breakfast snacks, cozy weather, tiny animals, desk objects, seasonal
        flowers, or mascot reactions. Use the same color direction and border words across prompts
        so the batch feels like one sticker pack.
      </p>

      <p>
        Keep kawaii prompts small and specific. One cute subject plus one emotion is usually easier
        for the generator than a crowded scene with many characters.
      </p>

      <div class="saas-related-links">
        <.link navigate={~p"/cute-sticker-ideas"}>Cute Sticker Ideas</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/custom-sticker-maker"}>Custom Sticker Maker</.link>
        <.link navigate={~p"/transparent-sticker-maker"}>Download PNG/WebP</.link>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="saas-faq">
      <details open>
        <summary>What makes a sticker kawaii?</summary>

        <p>
          A simple subject, soft expression, rounded details, gentle colors, and a clear sticker
          silhouette help the result feel kawaii.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I make a kawaii sticker batch?</summary>

        <p>
          Yes. Add several related prompts on separate lines and download the completed batch.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What prompts work well?</summary>

        <p>
          Try a tiny strawberry waving, sleepy kitten with moon pillow, smiling cloud, or happy
          coffee cup.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
